<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MY PROFILE</view><view class="h1">我的信息</view><view class="muted">微信身份会自动识别。预约时使用以下姓名和手机号。</view><view class="form card"><view class="label">姓名</view><input value="{{name}}" maxlength="40" placeholder="请输入姓名" bindinput="name" /><view class="label">手机号</view><input value="{{phone}}" type="tel" maxlength="21" placeholder="请输入手机号" bindinput="phone" /><button class="phone-button" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="wechatPhone">使用微信绑定手机号</button></view><button class="btn" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存信息</button></view>
